<title>SINGAPORE: Electronic Resources '96 net up 53.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Electronic Resources '96 net up 53.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   11.69    vs    7.60</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)	     10.00    vs   10.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	   8.70    vs    5.76</p>
<p>    Turnover		    919.10    vs  465.77</p>
<p>    Other income		  0.24    vs    0.19</p>
<p>    Interest expense	    3.14    vs    1.17</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     21.19    vs   12.55</p>
<p>    Tax			     4.40    vs    4.59</p>
<p>    Minorities		    5.11    vs    0.36</p>
<p>    Extraordinary		 0.15    vs    4.01</p>
<p>Note - Electronic Resources Ltd attributed higher profits to its regional expansion, especially from its HongKong companies, which contributed their first set of full year results.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
